msgid "Detect inconsistent test outcomes and track them over time. Configure quarantine where supported to mute or skip known flakes while someone owns fixing them; quarantine is not a repair."
msgstr "偵測不一致的測試結果並隨時間追蹤。在支援的情況下設定隔離，以便將已知的不穩定測試靜音或跳過，同時由專人負責修復；隔離並非修復手段。"

