msgstr "來自 Tuist 的工程文章，涵蓋建置基礎設施、開發者工作流程及編碼代理，並包含產品更新與技術決策。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/about.html.heex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every developer, and every agent working alongside them, needs fast, reliable feedback. We connect shared caching, build and test insights, and app previews to help teams move from a change to something they can test and review, with a stubborn commitment to sparking joy in the people who use it."
msgstr "每位開發者及其協作的編碼代理都需要快速且可靠的回饋。我們透過共享快取、建置與測試洞察以及應用程式預覽，協助團隊從程式碼變更推進至可測試與審查的狀態，並堅定致力於為使用者帶來愉悅體驗。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/compute.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For teams and coding agents constrained by build environments: run existing CI jobs next to your shared cache. Compute is invite-only; keep your CI workflows."
msgstr "適用於受建置環境限制的團隊與編碼代理：在共享快取旁執行現有的 CI 工作。運算資源目前僅限邀請使用；請保留你現有的 CI 工作流程。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/live/marketing_cache_live/cache.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For teams and coding agents repeating the same build work: share compatible outputs across development and CI without moving your jobs or replacing your coding agent."
msgstr "適用於重複執行相同建置工作的團隊與編碼代理：在開發與 CI 之間共享相容的輸出成果，無需移動工作或替換編碼代理。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/tests.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For teams and coding agents waiting on slow or unreliable test feedback: understand failures, identify flakes, and distribute test work without replacing your CI."
msgstr "適用於等待緩慢或不穩定測試回饋的團隊與編碼代理：了解失敗原因、識別不穩定測試，並分散測試工作，無需替換你的 CI。"

#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/tests.html.heex:173
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In Tuist-generated projects, the default selective-testing strategy skips test targets whose hashed inputs have not changed since their last successful run. It is not line-level impact analysis."
msgstr "在 Tuist 產生的專案中，預設的選擇性測試策略會跳過自上次成功執行以來雜湊輸入未變更的測試目標。這並非行層級的影響分析。"

